    cloude extensions
    Load this AFTER the main library and BEFORE you build your window:

        local Library = loadstring(readfile("cloude.lua"))()
        loadstring(readfile("cloude_extensions.lua"))()

    Adds: searchable dropdown, standalone keybind, progress bar, image/icon, status label,
    number box, text area, collapsible sections, page icons, toggle check animation, button ripple,
    typed notifications (stack limit + click to dismiss), splash screen, window minimize,
